# #1342: `:put ={expr}` puts the expression's result as lines. The rest of the line is the expression:
# an unescaped `"` starts a comment (`\"` is a quote), an empty one reuses the last expression (also
# one typed at a `"=` or `<C-r>=` prompt), and a bad one is E15 with nothing put.
